1
00:01:51,940 --> 00:01:53,440
致曼特城市民:
Citizens of Mantle:

2
00:01:53,815 --> 00:01:55,606
因最近一次的戮兽袭击
Following the most recent Grimm attack,

3
00:01:56,148 --> 00:01:59,523
暂时性的集会禁令现在已经颁布
a temporary prohibition of assembly is now in effect.

4
00:02:00,023 --> 00:02:02,606
任何公众集会都被禁止
There jare to be no public gatherings of any kind.

5
00:02:03,106 --> 00:02:06,231
请正常进行您的工作 并在宵禁前回到家中
Please conduct your business and return to your homes before curfew.

6
00:02:07,023 --> 00:02:08,773
这是为了您自身的安全
This is for your own safety.

7
00:02:10,481 --> 00:02:12,148
嘿 停下!
Hey, stop right there!

8
00:02:12,606 --> 00:02:14,190
别跑! 站住!
Stop running! Wait!

9
00:02:14,231 --> 00:02:15,940
虽然军队长官们都说
Though military officials have gone on record to say

10
00:02:16,023 --> 00:02:17,148
视频被做过手脚
the footage was doctored,

11
00:02:17,356 --> 00:02:22,440
但市民们仍坚持想要停用曼特城守护者
many citizens are still insisting that the Protector of Mantle be deactivated.

12
00:02:41,273 --> 00:02:42,273
平民
Civilian,

13
00:02:42,481 --> 00:02:45,231
您正在阻碍擎天军方作业
you are obstructing an Atlas military operation.

14
00:02:45,481 --> 00:02:46,773
请您让开
Please, step aside.

15
00:02:46,815 --> 00:02:48,773
这边情况还好吗?
Everything all right over here?

16
00:02:50,315 --> 00:02:52,356
呃 有人吗?
Uh, hello?

17
00:03:14,606 --> 00:03:16,690
这是最坏的状况
This is the worst case scenario.

18
00:03:16,773 --> 00:03:19,523
更多人牺牲 Penny被陷害
More people are dead, Penny's been framed,

19
00:03:19,565 --> 00:03:23,065
并且 杰克·雪倪莫名奇妙地成为了议员
and somehow, Jacques Schnee is sitting on the council.

20
00:03:23,273 --> 00:03:25,940
今天已经有第二批运往阿米特的货物被劫了
That's the second shipment for Amity that was hit today.

21
00:03:26,231 --> 00:03:28,023
看来昨晚的选举终于让
It seems election night was the last push

22
00:03:28,065 --> 00:03:30,023
罗宾从当地英雄
Robyn needed to go from hometown hero

23
00:03:30,065 --> 00:03:31,481
彻底变成了正义使者
to full-on vigilante.

24
00:03:31,606 --> 00:03:34,273
状况恐怕比想象的更加复杂
I'm afraid the problem is more complicated than that.

25
00:03:35,815 --> 00:03:38,773
看来罗宾的行为给我们在曼特城的供应商壮了胆
It seems Robyn has emboldened our suppliers in Mantle.

26
00:03:39,106 --> 00:03:40,648
他们拒绝向我们售卖任何东西
They're refusing to sell us provisions

27
00:03:40,690 --> 00:03:42,648
直到曼特城彻底恢复原状
until the city is adequately repaired.

28
00:03:43,065 --> 00:03:46,065
现在罗宾在向外派发她的团队偷来的物资
With Robyn redistributing the goods her team has stolen,

29
00:03:46,398 --> 00:03:48,981
阿米特工程已经无法继续了
the Amity Project is completely stalled.

30
00:03:49,273 --> 00:03:50,523
但我们已经那么接近了
But we're so close.

31
00:03:50,565 --> 00:03:52,648
一定有什么办法能让我们完成通讯塔的工程
There has to be some way we can finish the tower.

32
00:03:52,690 --> 00:03:55,690
有 颁布戒严法
There is: declaring martial law.

33
00:03:59,481 --> 00:04:02,440
你不会真的在考虑这个办法吧?
You're not actually considering that, are you?

34
00:04:03,440 --> 00:04:04,440
什么更重要?
What's more important?

35
00:04:04,981 --> 00:04:07,606
建立通讯 团结整个世界?
Establishing communications, unite the world?

36
00:04:08,731 --> 00:04:10,356
还是安抚几个小城区?
Or appeasing a few city blocks?

37
00:04:10,565 --> 00:04:13,273
别说的像什么鸡毛蒜皮的小事
Don't make is sound trivial when you know it isn't.

38
00:04:13,648 --> 00:04:16,648
你总说我们需要再多一些时间
You keep talking about how we just need a little more time,

39
00:04:16,690 --> 00:04:19,148
但你不是唯一在挣扎的人
but you're not the one having to struggle.

40
00:04:19,356 --> 00:04:22,981
我们都为大众的福祉做出过牺牲
We have all had to make sacrifices for the greater good.

41
00:04:23,565 --> 00:04:26,481
曼特城扛起了很多负担 是的 但
Mantle has had to bear a lot of the burden, yes, but--

42
00:04:26,523 --> 00:04:27,940
他们扛起了所有负担!
They're bearing all of it!

43
00:04:27,981 --> 00:04:29,940
你等得越久
The longer this waiting game goes on,

44
00:04:29,981 --> 00:04:32,440
城里的人就越痛苦
the harder each day gets for people down there

45
00:04:32,481 --> 00:04:35,190
而你还想送更多士兵进去?
and now you wanna send in more soldiers?

46
00:04:35,606 --> 00:04:37,731
你不能逼迫人们顺从
You can't force people to fall in line.

47
00:04:37,898 --> 00:04:41,356
如果你这么做了 你就只是将这些问题统统换成戮兽罢了
If you do that, you'll just be trading all of these problems for the Grimm.

48
00:04:51,148 --> 00:04:52,440
拜托了 埃隆伍德将军
Please, General Ironwood.

49
00:04:52,981 --> 00:04:54,690
这样紧逼曼特城
Squeezing Mantle this way...

50
00:04:55,190 --> 00:04:57,981
正是让塞伦如愿的做法
That kind of division plays right into Salem's hands.

51
00:04:58,606 --> 00:05:00,940
这就是提利安陷害你的理由
That's why Tyrian is here framing you.

52
00:05:01,065 --> 00:05:02,940
对了 这就是
Right, the reason we called

53
00:05:02,981 --> 00:05:04,190
我们叫你过来的原因
you here in the first place.

54
00:05:04,398 --> 00:05:06,273
你确定这就是你看到的那个人?
You're sure this was the man you saw?

55
00:05:06,815 --> 00:05:10,231
提利安‧卡洛斯多次被指控在生灵大陆行凶杀人
Tyrian Callows was accused of murders all across Anima.

56
00:05:10,648 --> 00:05:15,898
一个在囚犯交接被戮兽袭击时侥幸逃脱法律制裁的疯子杀人狂
A homicidal maniac who escaped justice when his prison transport was attacked by Grimm.

57
00:05:15,940 --> 00:05:17,898
在那之后 再也没有人见过他
After that, he was never seen again.

58
00:05:17,940 --> 00:05:21,356
他在为塞伦做事 并且他已经来到这儿了
Well, he works for Salem and he's here.

59
00:05:21,690 --> 00:05:24,606
如果我们曾对于擎天是塞伦的下一个目标这件事有过任何的怀疑
If we ever had any doubts Atlas was Salem's next target,

60
00:05:24,648 --> 00:05:26,773
现在那些疑虑也不复存在了
I think those are officially out the window.

61
00:05:26,815 --> 00:05:28,106
但现在我们有嫌疑人了
But now we have a suspect.

62
00:05:28,315 --> 00:05:29,315
我们可以告诉民众
We can tell the people.

63
00:05:29,356 --> 00:05:31,981
告诉他们逍遥法外的连环杀手正在曼特城造次
That a long-lost serial killer is loose in Mantle

64
00:05:32,023 --> 00:05:34,356
而军方还完全不知道他在哪
and the military has no idea where he is --

65
00:05:34,398 --> 00:05:36,356
或许会让情况好转前就变得更糟
might make things worse before they get better.

66
00:05:36,440 --> 00:05:38,940
我受够秘密了!
I am so sick of secrets!

67
00:05:39,023 --> 00:05:42,606
如果我们把阿米特和塞伦的事说出来
If we just told everyone about Amity, about Salem -

68
00:05:42,898 --> 00:05:44,606
不能那么做!
We can't!

69
00:05:45,690 --> 00:05:47,190
如果我们现在告诉他们阿米特的事
If we talk about Amity now,

70
00:05:47,231 --> 00:05:48,523
我们将有被塞伦的人盯上的风险
we risk Salem's forces,

71
00:05:48,565 --> 00:05:50,981
我们知道他们已经在这儿 想要破坏我们的计划
who we know are here, working to sabotage it.

72
00:05:51,190 --> 00:05:52,815
如果我们现在告诉他们塞伦的事
If we tell them about Salem now,

73
00:05:52,940 --> 00:05:56,148
我们则会面临 在团结树不子前就被戮兽摧毁的风险
we risk falling to the Grimm before we can reunite Remnant.

74
00:05:56,356 --> 00:05:58,981
我们必须完成通讯塔
We have to finish the tower.

75
00:05:59,856 --> 00:06:01,356
我要拘留罗宾·休
I want Robyn Hill in custody.

76
00:06:01,648 --> 00:06:04,565
如果她能让曼特城好好合作 我们可以跟她谈谈条件
We can offer her a deal if she gets Mantle to cooperate.

77
00:06:04,898 --> 00:06:05,856
我们会找到办法的
We'll figure it out.

78
00:06:05,940 --> 00:06:08,481
不去处理罗宾事宜的人则关注提利安的情况
Anyone not assisting with Robyn needs to focus on Tyrian.

79
00:06:08,981 --> 00:06:10,481
我要知道他在跟谁一起做事
I want to know who he's working with,

80
00:06:10,523 --> 00:06:12,481
在哪躲藏 还有他的计划
where he's hiding, what he's planning,

81
00:06:12,648 --> 00:06:16,106
以及他究竟是怎么把Penny的视频传遍了我的王国
and how exactly that video of Penny got all over my kingdom.

82
00:06:19,565 --> 00:06:21,440
我说得够清楚了吗?
Do I make myself clear?

83
00:06:21,940 --> 00:06:24,148
是的 长官
Yes, sir.

84
00:06:30,481 --> 00:06:32,273
我们快到51街区了
Looks like we're approaching 51st.

85
00:06:32,940 --> 00:06:34,981
感谢你们两位的协助
Thanks for the assist on this, you two.

86
00:06:35,231 --> 00:06:37,481
我们现在虽然都在不同卡车里
Now, we may all be split between different trucks,

87
00:06:37,523 --> 00:06:39,315
如果罗宾的队伍上钩的话
but we need to be ready to act as one

88
00:06:39,356 --> 00:06:41,190
但我们需要随时准备好合作
in case Robyn's team takes the bait.

89
00:06:41,440 --> 00:06:43,856
如果你所在的卡车被袭击 则立即追击
If your truck is hit, pursue immediately.

90
00:06:44,190 --> 00:06:46,523
其他人会以最快的速度提供支援
Everyone else will move in as fast as possible.

91
00:06:46,565 --> 00:06:48,690
现在进入无线电静默 完毕
Going radio silent. Over.

92
00:06:51,190 --> 00:06:52,106
你觉不觉得
Do you...

93
00:06:54,440 --> 00:06:56,315
你觉不觉得我们应该把塞伦的事告诉埃隆伍德
Do you think we should've told Ironwood about Salem,

94
00:06:56,898 --> 00:06:58,940
在他为阿米特投入如此多之前?
before he put so much on the line for Amity?

95
00:06:58,981 --> 00:07:00,940
听起来你想告诉他
Sounds like you do.

96
00:07:02,648 --> 00:07:05,856
我信任Ruby 但我觉得他应当知道
I trust Ruby, but I think he deserves to know

97
00:07:05,898 --> 00:07:06,898
他要踏进什么领域
what he's stepping into.

98
00:07:07,356 --> 00:07:07,856
我们是知道的
We all did.

99
00:07:10,315 --> 00:07:11,648
你不同意
You don't agree.

100
00:07:12,231 --> 00:07:12,981
看看周围吧
Look around.

101
00:07:13,565 --> 00:07:15,731
禁令 街上的军队
The embargo, the military presence,

102
00:07:15,773 --> 00:07:17,731
禁止集会
the restrictions on assembly.

103
00:07:17,773 --> 00:07:20,148
他很容易反应过度
He's a bit prone to overreacting.

104
00:07:20,190 --> 00:07:22,398
的确 这点无法否认
Yeah, hard to argue with that.

105
00:07:22,606 --> 00:07:25,565
但 他也没有什么别的选择
Still, he didn't have a lot of good options.

106
00:07:25,731 --> 00:07:29,398
大概所有人都没有更好的选择了
I'm not sure there are many good options left for any of us anymore.

107
00:07:29,440 --> 00:07:32,315
藏着秘密 结束他人的生命?
Keeping secrets, taking lives?

108
00:07:32,606 --> 00:07:37,648
有时我会思考 我们到底要为了所谓正确做到什么程度
It makes you wonder how far we're gonna have to go to keep doing the right thing.

109
00:07:37,690 --> 00:07:38,273
Blake
Blake.

110
00:07:40,773 --> 00:07:43,356
我们只是做了我们必须做的
We did what we had to do.

111
00:07:45,940 --> 00:07:46,398
我知道
I know.

112
00:07:47,398 --> 00:07:51,606
但下次 我想确保我们可以不去做那些事
But, next time, I wanna make sure we don't have to,

113
00:07:52,148 --> 00:07:55,690
而且我可以告诉你 偷袭一个只是想要帮助大家的猎人
and I can tell you, ambushing a Huntress who's just trying to help

114
00:07:55,731 --> 00:07:57,690
并不是我乐意选择的道路
isn't an option I'm thrilled about choosing.

115
00:08:00,440 --> 00:08:01,898
或许 我们不应该这么做
Then, maybe we shouldn't.

116
00:08:06,398 --> 00:08:07,356
她怎么样了?
How is she doing?

117
00:08:07,398 --> 00:08:10,106
她很困惑 很害怕
She's confused, scared.

118
00:08:10,315 --> 00:08:12,648
我们很快就能有她视觉系统存储的信息了
We'll have her recorded visual data shortly.

119
00:08:12,940 --> 00:08:14,190
那应该能证明她是清自的
That should prove her innocence,

120
00:08:14,231 --> 00:08:17,690
但损害已经产生了
but the damage has already been done.

121
00:08:18,565 --> 00:08:20,356
人们对于她的议论
The things people are saying about her...

122
00:08:21,690 --> 00:08:24,106
如果Penny当时不在场 罗宾早就
If Penny hadn't been there, Robyn would be--

123
00:08:26,356 --> 00:08:28,398
我并不觉得他们的目标是罗宾
I don't think Robyn was their target.

124
00:08:28,898 --> 00:08:31,565
塞伦的目的一直是将我们分裂
Salem's goal has always been to divide us.

125
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:34,481
他们就想要Penny在场
I think Penny was exactly where they wanted her,

126
00:08:35,565 --> 00:08:37,356
就像维特节时一样
just like at the Vytal Festival.

127
00:08:37,690 --> 00:08:39,356
就跟那时一样
And just like back then,

128
00:08:39,648 --> 00:08:43,273
有人在利用我们自己的科技来对付我们
someone is using our own technology against us.

129
00:08:43,481 --> 00:08:45,190
这些被处理过的视频
This doctored footage of Penny

130
00:08:45,231 --> 00:08:47,190
都是从Penny在曼特城的工作视频中剪的
came from her work all around Mantle,

131
00:08:47,648 --> 00:08:50,190
直接从我们的监控系统盗出来的
stolen straight from our surveillance network.

132
00:08:50,231 --> 00:08:53,148
啊 黑客 高科技
Ugh, hacking, technology...

133
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:55,481
为什么现代人不能跟以前一样
Why can't people just do what they used to

134
00:08:55,523 --> 00:08:56,815
靠正义的互殴来分胜负呢?
and fight to the death?

135
00:08:57,190 --> 00:08:58,440
要我说的话 这样多简单
A lot simpler, if you ask me.

136
00:08:58,523 --> 00:09:01,106
如果我们要对付的就是信标那时候的敌人的话
Well, if we're dealing with the same enemy from Beacon,

137
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:03,898
黑入曼特城的系统对他们来说确实很简单
hacking into Mantle's system would be simple.

138
00:09:04,190 --> 00:09:08,148
幸运的是 擎天剩下的部分都使用了升级的网络
Fortunately, the rest of Atlas is running on an upgraded network.

139
00:09:08,356 --> 00:09:10,648
但是为什么有人可以访问那个网络?
And how would someone get access to that network?

140
00:09:10,981 --> 00:09:13,273
只有少部分人有权限
Well, only a few people have clearance.

141
00:09:13,481 --> 00:09:17,481
埃隆伍德 议会 我们的网络安全与监视负责人
Ironwood, the council, our cybersecurity and surveillance leads

142
00:09:17,523 --> 00:09:18,898
可能还有小部分
and maybe a select few

143
00:09:18,940 --> 00:09:22,481
需要监控像是城市污水和供暖这样关键系统的人
who oversee critical systems like sewage or the heating grid.

144
00:09:22,981 --> 00:09:26,023
供暖网络是和雪倪尘晶公司合作运营的
The heating grid run in partnership with the Schnee Dust Company.

145
00:09:26,065 --> 00:09:27,106
你在想什么?
What are you thinking?

146
00:09:27,815 --> 00:09:30,898
现在我还不知道 但总有些不对劲
I don't know yet, but something isn't right.

147
00:09:31,523 --> 00:09:33,398
这样形容这个时代 真宽容
Understatement of the century.

148
00:09:35,065 --> 00:09:36,356
那你状态怎么样?
And how are you doing?

149
00:09:36,731 --> 00:09:39,606
如果这几周来不是玛丽亚一直在帮我的话
If Maria hadn't offered to help me these past weeks,

150
00:09:39,648 --> 00:09:41,606
我现在可能已经累倒了
I'd have likely collapsed by now.

151
00:09:42,023 --> 00:09:44,565
要把通讯塔发射到天上去
Getting a communications tower into the sky

152
00:09:44,606 --> 00:09:46,356
就已经很困难了
seems impossible on its own,

153
00:09:46,398 --> 00:09:51,148
但现在更要考虑人们要对我的女儿做什么.
but now, to think of what people wanna do to my girl...

154
00:09:54,815 --> 00:09:57,065
即使最糟糕的情况发生了
Even if the worst does happen,

155
00:09:57,273 --> 00:09:59,315
你也可以重新激活她
you can always reactivate her again,

156
00:09:59,606 --> 00:10:02,106
所以你也别太担心了
so maybe try not to worry so much.

157
00:10:03,648 --> 00:10:07,231
Penny这么特别是有原因的
There's a reason why Penny is the only one of her kind.

158
00:10:12,065 --> 00:10:14,648
当将军第一次找到我们
When the General first challenged us

159
00:10:14,898 --> 00:10:17,565
说要实现一项国防领域的科技突破
to find the next breakthrough in defense technology,

160
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:22,773
我大多数的同事都选择了更平常的方向
most of my colleagues pursued more obvious choices.

161
00:10:23,273 --> 00:10:28,648
而我是那试图从内在找到灵感的少数人之一
I was one of the few who believed in looking inward for inspiration.

162
00:10:29,648 --> 00:10:31,523
你想创造一个拥有灵魂的守护者
You wanted a protector with a soul

163
00:10:32,898 --> 00:10:37,273
是的 当埃隆伍德将军看到她时 他也很赞同
I did. And when General Ironwood saw her, he did too.

164
00:10:37,856 --> 00:10:42,690
出乎意料的是 Penny计划竟然能从众多提案中脱颖而出
Much to my surprise, the Penny Project was chosen over all the other proposals.

165
00:10:42,731 --> 00:10:44,690
你为什么会觉得惊讶?
Why would you be surprised?

166
00:10:44,731 --> 00:10:46,690
你创造了人工元气
You created an artificial Aura.

167
00:10:47,231 --> 00:10:48,898
并不完全是
Vell, not quite

168
00:10:53,398 --> 00:10:55,690
你把你的一部分元气给了她?
You gave her part of yours?

169
00:10:55,981 --> 00:10:59,523
是的 每一次我重做Penny
Yes, and each time I rebuild Penny,

170
00:10:59,565 --> 00:11:01,065
就会分出去更多元气
it takes a little more.

171
00:11:01,523 --> 00:11:04,315
如果人们真能如愿把她毁掉的话
If the people get their wish and she's destroyed,

172
00:11:04,815 --> 00:11:06,648
我要怎么...
I won't be able to...

173
00:11:14,940 --> 00:11:17,356
我们会找到幕后黑手的
We'll find whoever's responsible.

174
00:11:19,023 --> 00:11:19,815
我保证
I promise.

175
00:11:29,273 --> 00:11:30,023
罗宾
Robyn--

176
00:11:30,481 --> 00:11:30,898
跑路!
Scramble!

177
00:11:30,940 --> 00:11:31,648
别 等等!
No, wait!

178
00:11:33,481 --> 00:11:36,148
分散 然后在藏身处集合
Split up, and regroup at the hideout.

179
00:11:51,398 --> 00:11:53,023
请等一下 我们只是想...
Please stop, we just want to--

180
00:12:11,106 --> 00:12:15,523
如果埃隆伍德想抓我的话 他不应该派小孩子来
If Ironwood wants me, he'll have to send more than a couple of kids.

181
00:12:15,565 --> 00:12:16,023
他已经派人来了
He is.

182
00:12:16,398 --> 00:12:18,440
货车停下时金牌特工已经收到警报了
Stopping the trucks alerted the Ace Ops.

183
00:12:18,690 --> 00:12:22,106
我们在他们赶来之前没多少时间 所以请听我们说
We don't have long before they arrive, so please listen to us.

184
00:12:22,148 --> 00:12:23,398
你需要知道真相
You need to know the truth.

185
00:12:24,190 --> 00:12:24,815
你在拖时间
You're stalling.

186
00:12:24,856 --> 00:12:27,398
阿米特竞技场 所有这些物资 都是为了.
Amity Colosseum, all these supplies, they're for...

187
00:12:31,315 --> 00:12:33,440
都是为了一座新的通讯塔
They're for a new communications tower.

188
00:12:34,981 --> 00:12:36,481
这说不通啊
That doesn't make any sense.

189
00:12:36,731 --> 00:12:38,565
一座新的通讯塔意味着王国能够...
A new tower means the kingdoms can finally--

190
00:12:38,606 --> 00:12:40,148
我知道通讯塔意味着什么 打拳妹
I know what the tower means, Fisticuffs.

191
00:12:43,731 --> 00:12:45,065
来一个人握住我的手
One of you take my hand.

192
00:12:45,440 --> 00:12:46,023
什么?
What?

193
00:12:46,065 --> 00:12:47,398
你们说过时间紧迫
You said time is short.

194
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:49,398
握住我的手 否则我就走了
Either take it, or I'm gone.

195
00:12:58,606 --> 00:13:02,356
再说一遍 埃隆伍德在苔原上造什么?
Tell me again, what is Ironwood building out in the tundra?

196
00:13:03,606 --> 00:13:05,398
一座新的通讯塔
A new communications tower.

197
00:13:05,856 --> 00:13:08,690
他想帮助每一个人
He's trying to help everyone.

198
00:13:11,606 --> 00:13:12,815
你说的是事实
You're telling the truth.

199
00:13:13,356 --> 00:13:14,648
好方便的外像力
Handy semblance.

200
00:13:14,690 --> 00:13:16,148
那为什么要守口如瓶?
Why keep that a secret?

201
00:13:16,315 --> 00:13:18,523
因为他不知道谁是可以信任的
Because he doesn't know who he can trust.

202
00:13:19,148 --> 00:13:21,231
擎天并不是要搞事
Atlas isn't out to get anybody..

203
00:13:21,440 --> 00:13:23,440
那些在曼特城杀平民的人
The people murdering civilians in Mantle

204
00:13:23,481 --> 00:13:25,940
就是想让它看起来像一个事实
are just trying to make it look that way.

205
00:13:26,398 --> 00:13:28,481
如果那些人知道阿米特的话
And if those same people learn about Amity,

206
00:13:28,523 --> 00:13:30,815
他们会想尽一切办法摧毁它
they'd do everything in their power to destroy it.

207
00:13:30,856 --> 00:13:31,898
所以他们是谁?
So, who are they?

208
00:13:32,148 --> 00:13:33,731
这一切的背后是谁
Who's actually behind this?

209
00:13:33,773 --> 00:13:35,731
Yang Blake 你们在哪里?
Yang, Blake, where are you?

210
00:13:36,190 --> 00:13:37,315
我们现在还不能告诉你
We can't tell you that part yet.

211
00:13:37,356 --> 00:13:37,898
啊 扯...
Ugh, bullsh--

212
00:13:37,940 --> 00:13:40,565
听着 我们信任你 所以也希望你能相信我们所说的
Look, we are trusting you, so trust us when we say

213
00:13:40,606 --> 00:13:43,273
在阿米特通讯塔完工前 它必须要保密
that Amity Tower needs to stay a secret until it's done.

214
00:13:43,856 --> 00:13:45,065
我们只需要更多的时间
We just need a little more time.

215
00:13:45,106 --> 00:13:46,315
这边 快来 在这边
This way, come on, over here.

216
00:13:47,023 --> 00:13:47,731
我们看见他们往这儿跑了
We saw them over this way.

217
00:13:47,773 --> 00:13:49,440
快跑 我们把他们引开
Run, we'll throw them off.

218
00:13:51,773 --> 00:13:54,648
直到知道全部真相前 我都不会停手
I won't stop until I know the whole truth.

219
00:14:03,690 --> 00:14:05,231
就在这扇门后面
It's right behind that door.

220
00:14:06,190 --> 00:14:07,606
创造神杖
The Staff of Creation.

221
00:14:08,523 --> 00:14:10,648
我本来希望把你带到这里
I hoped bringing you down here

222
00:14:10,690 --> 00:14:11,648
能够唤起一些回忆
might jog some memories.

223
00:14:12,065 --> 00:14:15,898
毕竟 用神杖把擎天升到空中是你的想法
After all, it was your idea to use the staff to lift Atlas off the ground.

224
00:14:16,648 --> 00:14:19,481
我本以为是重力尘晶让擎天悬浮的
I thought gravity dust kept Atlas afloat?

225
00:14:19,523 --> 00:14:20,898
那只是个对公众的说辞罢了
Eh, that's the public story.

226
00:14:21,731 --> 00:14:25,773
但是有了这神杖 我们就有了一个稳定且似乎无尽的能量源
But with the staff, we have a constant, seemingly limitless energy source.

227
00:14:26,606 --> 00:14:28,856
奥兹曾推测它可以想升得多高就升多高
Oz once speculated it could take us as high as we wanted..

228
00:14:30,065 --> 00:14:33,856
说实话 这是阿米特计划的灵感来源
To tell you the truth, that served as the inspiration for the Amity Project.

229
00:14:34,231 --> 00:14:36,106
把通讯塔升到空中
Get a communication tower up in the sky.

230
00:14:36,148 --> 00:14:38,106
升到戮兽无法生存的地方
higher than the Grimm can survive

231
00:14:38,648 --> 00:14:40,523
那样我们互相之间就再也不会失去联系
so we never lose contact with each other again.

232
00:14:41,106 --> 00:14:43,815
但是 你们没用神杖来抬升阿米特
But, you're not using the staff to raise Amity.

233
00:14:43,981 --> 00:14:46,190
毕竟神杖只能用在一个地方
The staff can only be used for one purpose at a time.

234
00:14:47,023 --> 00:14:50,023
我们会用传统的方法抬升阿米特 尘晶
We're going to have to do Amity the old-fashioned way, dust and all.

235
00:14:51,190 --> 00:14:56,106
我的一部分曾经协助完成了这一切 感觉太奇怪了
It feels strange, knowing that part of me helped come up with all this.

236
00:14:56,148 --> 00:14:57,648
你肯定会习惯的
You'll get used to it, I'm sure.

237
00:14:58,148 --> 00:15:00,481
最后 你甚至都分辨不出谁是谁
Eventually, you won't even know who's who anymore.

238
00:15:01,856 --> 00:15:02,773
是的
Right.

239
00:15:04,440 --> 00:15:06,898
我们没法常常见上面
We didn't always see eye to eye,

240
00:15:07,856 --> 00:15:11,815
但我还是希望能够问问奥兹乎对这一切的看法
but I wish I could ask Ozpin what he thought of all of this.

241
00:15:12,523 --> 00:15:14,856
但是 我能告诉你我是怎么想的
Well, I can tell you what I think.

242
00:15:15,648 --> 00:15:19,315
你要走的这条路 这条只有你知道答案的
The path you're heading down where you're the only one with the answers,

243
00:15:19,856 --> 00:15:22,648
你会付出任何代价来做你认为正确之事的路
where you do the thing you think is right no matter the cost,

244
00:15:23,190 --> 00:15:25,315
是无法带你走向胜利的
it's not going to take you anywhere good.

245
00:15:31,190 --> 00:15:34,523
我们必须阻止塞伦 不顾一切
We have to stop Salem, nothing matters more.

246
00:15:35,565 --> 00:15:38,315
我觉得 有些事情还是要顾及的
Some things matter more, I think.

247
00:15:39,356 --> 00:15:43,440
保持我们的人性 这就是我们与她的区别
Keeping our humanity. It's what makes us different from her.

248
00:15:46,315 --> 00:15:48,565
有时候我担心这是她最大的优势
Sometimes I worry that's her greatest advantage.

249
00:15:49,731 --> 00:15:52,981
没有了人性 她会害怕吗?
Without humanity, does she still feel fear?

250
00:15:53,523 --> 00:15:55,148
她会犹豫吗?
Does she ever hesitate?

251
00:15:56,148 --> 00:16:01,190
当塞伦进攻信标的时候 算上我所有的飞船 所有的士兵
When Salem hit Beacon, even with all my ships, all of my soldiers,

252
00:16:01,940 --> 00:16:03,898
我也无法与她抗衡
I was no match for her.

253
00:16:04,940 --> 00:16:06,690
我从来没有感到那么无助过
I've never felt so helpless,

254
00:16:08,398 --> 00:16:11,315
她宣告自己降临的方式
the way she told me she was there.

255
00:16:22,731 --> 00:16:24,106
恐惧很正常
It's okay to be afraid.

256
00:16:26,315 --> 00:16:28,190
只是不能让恐惧控制了你
You just can't let that fear control you.

257
00:16:30,523 --> 00:16:32,565
我不想走狮心的老路
I am not going to end up like Lionheart.

258
00:16:34,606 --> 00:16:35,731
你相信我吗?
Do you believe in me?

259
00:16:39,398 --> 00:16:43,065
我相信你 但不仅仅是你
I dobelieve in you, but not only you.

260
00:16:44,190 --> 00:16:46,773
我觉得最好的方法是坐下来
I think the best thing you could do is sit down

261
00:16:46,815 --> 00:16:48,898
和你最害怕的人谈谈
and talk with the people you're most afraid to.

262
00:16:52,190 --> 00:16:54,273
你现在听起来开始像他了
Now you are starting to sound like him.

263
00:17:11,190 --> 00:17:13,315
温特 什么事?
Winter, what is it?

264
00:17:27,565 --> 00:17:28,356
发生了什么?
What's going on?

265
00:17:29,440 --> 00:17:31,106
看起来你的愿望成真了
It looks like you're getting your wish.

266
00:17:31,523 --> 00:17:33,606
我父亲的第一步行动
My father's first act.

267
00:17:34,106 --> 00:17:35,940
我们都被邀请去参加晚宴
We've all been invited to dinner

268
00:17:36,231 --> 00:17:39,231
将军得在宴会上捍卫他在议会的席位
where the General will be defending his seat on the Council.